{
    "background_story": "Bunny was a hardworking rabbit who lived in a cozy burrow on a lush meadow. She was known for her remarkable gardening skills, cultivating the most vibrant and sought-after vegetables in the meadow. Every morning, Bunny would wake up before dawn to tend to her garden, carefully nurturing each plant to ensure a bountiful harvest. Her dedication paid off, as her produce became the go-to choice for the meadow's top chefs and restaurants. Bunny's earnings from her garden allowed her to live a comfortable life, but she didn't stop there. She invested her profits in a community garden project, teaching other meadow creatures how to grow their own food and become earners themselves. Bunny's entrepreneurial spirit and generosity made her a respected and beloved figure in the meadow.",
